    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.1	Completion of designs for at least 15 sites;
2.1 Completion of conservation works for at least 15 sites;
3.1 At least 6 educational events carried out with students;
3.2 At least 4 community engagement events carried out with the participation of women from both communities;
3.3 At least 20 young people engaged with the work of the TCCH as Heritage Youth Ambassadors;
3.4 Production of a 3D documentation and educational game for students for at least 1 of the Famagusta cultural heritage site;
3.5 At least 4 inspection visits conducted to completed TCCH project sites;
3.6  Implementation of capacity building activities and/or preventive conservation actions to at least 4 completed TCCH project sites;
4.1 Visibility / completion ceremonies for each completed project;
4.2 At least one press releases issued for each project completed;
4.3 At least 2 updates per month on the work of the TCCH shared on social media;
4.4 At least 8 Heritage Youth Ambassadors share content on the work of TCCH on social media.</narrative>
    </description>
